From ec8b763ed3035a558c23245582ecd69482c630e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: itvedas29 <itvedas29@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:30:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add one shared, plain-language site navigation

- partials/site-nav.html: single source for the top bar. Six menus with a
  one-line description under every link: Learn IT, News, Software,
  Free tools, Careers, Help, plus site search and a Start learning button
- css/site-nav.css, js/site-nav.js: scoped styles and behaviour (hover and
  click menus, keyboard and Escape, mobile menu, / to search, current section)
- scripts/apply-site-nav.py: replaces the 273 different old bars on every
  page with the shared one; --check mode runs in CI, and the autopilot runs
  it so new articles and news get the same bar
- problems-solutions.html: move its problem search box out of the old bar
- software.css: drop the old nav styles
---
